TPC-DERIVED FILES in benchbox-datagen (TPC-DS 4.0.0 kit)

The following files are derived from the TPC-DS 4.0.0 kit (dsdgen, its distribution
files and column list), a Work covered by the TPC legal notice above. The notice
applies to them:

- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/columns.rs: generated from tools/column_list.txt of the TPC-DS 4.0.0 kit (the column list mkheader turns into dsdgen's columns.h)
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/dims.rs: the scaling.dst row-count weights (row_spec, source_table_rows), the zip-to-GMT offset table (GMT_OFFSETS) and dimension source-table generators ported from dsdgen
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/scd.rs: slowly-changing dimension source-table generators ported from dsdgen
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/orders.rs: purchase, catalog order and web order source-table generators ported from dsdgen
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/plan.rs: update-date selection and per-day row scaling ported from dsdgen
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/calendar.rs: calendar and date routines ported from dsdgen, reading calendar.dst
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/ctx.rs: join-key and catalog-page routines ported from dsdgen
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/rng.rs: random-stream seeding by column number ported from dsdgen
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/out.rs: field formatting of dsdgen's row printers
- crates/benchbox-datagen-core/src/tpcds_update/mod.rs: refresh-set file layout and delete files ported from dsdgen
